{"id":34,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَمَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ وَلَهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَمْدُ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَخِرَةِۚ وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَكِيمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْخَب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"يَعْلَمُ مَا يَلِجُ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ وَمَا يَخْرُجُ مِنْهَا وَمَا يَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>ِلُ مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءِ وَمَا يَعْرُجُ فِيهَاۚ وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رَّحِيمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْغَف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>رُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"وَقَالَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لَا تَأْتِينَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّاعَةُۖ قُلْ بَلَىٰ وَرَبِّى لَتَأْتِيَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َكُمْ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِمِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْغَيْبِۖ لَا يَعْزُبُ عَنْهُ مِثْقَالُ ذَرَّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ةٍ ف</span>ِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَلَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ وَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَصْغَرُ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ذ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ وَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَكْبَرُ إِلَّا فِى كِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">بٍ م</span>ُّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"لِّيَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>زِىَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَعَمِلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِۚ أُ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">وْ</span>لَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>ئِكَ لَه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>َّغْفِرَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٌ و</span>َرِزْ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">قٌ ك</span>َر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ سَعَوْ ف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> ءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِنَا مُعَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>جِزِينَ أُ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">وْ</span>لَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>ئِكَ لَهُمْ عَذَا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">بٌ م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>زٍ أَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥</span>"},{"id":6,"tajweed":"وَيَرَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ أُوتُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعِلْمَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> أُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>ِلَ إِلَيْكَ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>َّبِّكَ هُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقَّ وَيَهْد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> إِلَىٰ صِر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>طِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦</span>"},{"id":7,"tajweed":"وَقَالَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> هَلْ نَدُلُّكُمْ عَلَىٰ رَجُ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">لٍ ي</span>ُنَبِّئُكُمْ إِذَا مُزِّ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>تُمْ كُلَّ مُمَزَّقٍ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َكُمْ لَفِى خَلْ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">قٍ ج</span>َد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧</span>"},{"id":8,"tajweed":"أَفْتَرَىٰ عَلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ كَذِبًا أ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">َم ب</span>ِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> جِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َۗ<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">ةُۢ ب</span>َلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَخِرَةِ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَذَابِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ضَّلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبَع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨</span>"},{"id":9,"tajweed":"أَفَلَمْ يَرَوْ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> إِلَىٰ مَا بَيْنَ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَمَا خَلْفَه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِۚ إ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن ن</span>َّشَأْ نَخْسِفْ بِهِمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضَ أَوْ نُسْقِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">طْ</span> عَلَيْهِمْ كِسَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">فًا م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءِۚ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ فِى ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ لَأَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ةً ل</span>ِّكُلِّ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">دٍ م</span>ُّن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٩</span>"},{"id":10,"tajweed":"۞ وَلَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> ءَاتَيْنَا دَاوُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span>دَ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا فَضْل<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">اًۖ ي</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>جِبَالُ أَوِّبِى مَعَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>طَّيْرَۖ وَأَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا لَهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٠</span>"},{"id":11,"tajweed":"أَنِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>عْمَلْ سَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بِغَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">تٍ و</span>َقَدِّرْ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّرْدِۖ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>عْمَلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> صَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِحًاۖ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>ِى بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ بَص<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١١</span>"},{"id":12,"tajweed":"وَلِسُلَيْمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رِّيحَ غُدُوُّهَا شَهْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ و</span>َرَوَاحُهَا شَهْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌۖ و</span>َأَسَلْنَا لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> عَيْنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">طْ</span>رِۖ وَمِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>ِ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َعْمَلُ بَيْنَ يَدَيْهِ بِإِذْنِ رَبِّهِ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۖۦ</span> وَم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َزِغْ مِنْهُمْ عَنْ أَمْرِنَا نُذِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>هُ مِنْ عَذَابِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٢</span>"},{"id":13,"tajweed":"يَعْمَلُونَ لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مَا يَش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن م</span>َّحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>رِيبَ وَتَمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ثِيلَ وَجِفَا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نٍ ك</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجَوَابِ وَقُدُو<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">رٍ ر</span>َّاسِيَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تٍۚ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>عْمَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> ءَالَ دَاوُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span>دَ شُكْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رًاۚ و</span>َقَلِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">لٌ م</span>ِّنْ عِبَادِىَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>رُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٣</span>"},{"id":14,"tajweed":"فَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا قَضَيْنَا عَلَيْهِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَوْتَ مَا دَلَّهُمْ عَلَىٰ مَوْتِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِۦٓ</span> إِلَّا د<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">َا</span>ٓبَّةُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ تَأْكُلُ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نس</span>َأَتَهُۖ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> فَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا خَرَّ تَبَيَّنَتِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>ُ أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">َن ل</span>َّوْ كَانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> يَعْلَمُونَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْغَيْبَ مَا لَبِثُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَذَابِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٤</span>"},{"id":15,"tajweed":"لَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> كَانَ لِسَبَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">إٍ ف</span>ِى مَسْكَنِهِمْ ءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ةٌۖ ج</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َتَانِ ع<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َمِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">نٍ و</span>َشِمَا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">لٍۖ ك</span>ُلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>ِّزْقِ رَبِّكُمْ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>شْكُرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لَهُۚ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> بَلْدَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ةٌ ط</span>َيِّبَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٌ و</span>َرَبٌّ غَف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٥</span>"},{"id":16,"tajweed":"فَأَعْرَضُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فَأَرْسَلْنَا عَلَيْهِمْ سَيْلَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَرِمِ وَبَدَّلْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِجَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َتَيْهِمْ جَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َتَيْنِ ذَوَات<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َىْ</span> أُكُلٍ خَمْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">طٍ و</span>َأَثْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">لٍ و</span>َش<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َىْءٍ م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن س</span>ِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">رٍ ق</span>َل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>لٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٦</span>"},{"id":17,"tajweed":"ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ جَزَيْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِمَا كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْۖ</span> وَهَلْ نُجَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ز<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> إِلَّا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>رَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٧</span>"},{"id":18,"tajweed":"وَجَعَلْنَا بَيْنَهُمْ وَبَيْنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُرَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّتِى بَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>رَكْنَا فِيهَا قُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">رًى ظ</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هِرَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةً و</span>َقَدَّرْنَا فِيهَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّيْرَۖ سِيرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فِيهَا لَيَالِىَ وَأَيَّامًا ءَامِن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٨</span>"},{"id":19,"tajweed":"فَقَالُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> رَبَّنَا بَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>عِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> بَيْنَ أَسْفَارِنَا وَظَلَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>ُسَهُمْ فَجَعَلْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُمْ أَحَادِيثَ وَمَزَّ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>نَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُمْ كُلَّ مُمَزَّقٍۚ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ فِى ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ لَأَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">تٍ ل</span>ِّكُلِّ صَبَّا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">رٍ ش</span>َك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>رٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٩</span>"},{"id":20,"tajweed":"وَلَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> صَدَّقَ عَلَيْهِمْ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لِيسُ ظَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>تَّبَعُوهُ إِلَّا فَرِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">قًا م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُؤْمِن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٠</span>"},{"id":21,"tajweed":"وَمَا كَانَ لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> عَلَيْه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ِم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن س</span>ُلْطَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نٍ إِلَّا لِنَعْلَمَ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>ُؤْمِنُ بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَخِرَةِ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َنْ هُوَ مِنْهَا فِى شَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">كٍّۗ و</span>َرَبُّكَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ حَف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>ظٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢١</span>"},{"id":22,"tajweed":"قُلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>عُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ زَعَمْت<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن د</span>ُونِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِۖ لَا يَمْلِكُونَ مِثْقَالَ ذَرَّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ةٍ ف</span>ِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَلَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ وَمَا لَهُمْ فِيهِمَا مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ش</span>ِرْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">كٍ و</span>َمَا لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مِنْه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ظ</span>َه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٢</span>"},{"id":23,"tajweed":"وَلَا تَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>َعُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّفَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>عَةُ عِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ند</span>َهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ</span> إِلَّا لِمَنْ أَذِنَ لَهُۚ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> حَتَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> إِذَا فُزِّعَ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>ُلُوبِهِمْ قَالُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مَاذَا قَالَ رَبُّكُمْۖ قَالُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقَّۖ وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَلِىُّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٣</span>"},{"id":24,"tajweed":"۞ قُلْ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َرْزُقُك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِۖ قُلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُۖ وَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَوْ إِيَّاكُمْ لَعَلَىٰ هُدًى أَوْ فِى ضَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">لٍ م</span>ُّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٤</span>"},{"id":25,"tajweed":"قُل لَّا تُسْــَٔلُونَ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>رَمْنَا وَلَا نُسْــَٔلُ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا تَعْمَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٥</span>"},{"id":26,"tajweed":"قُلْ يَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>مَعُ بَيْنَنَا رَبُّنَا ثُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ يَفْتَحُ بَيْنَنَا بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقِّ وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفَتَّاحُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٦</span>"},{"id":27,"tajweed":"قُلْ أَرُونِىَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ أَلْحَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>ت<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> شُرَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَۖ كَلَّاۚ بَلْ هُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٧</span>"},{"id":28,"tajweed":"وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَرْسَلْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كَ إِلَّا ك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">َا</span>ٓفَّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ةً ل</span>ِّل<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َاسِ بَشِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رًا و</span>َنَذِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رًا و</span>َلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ أَكْثَرَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َاسِ لَا يَعْلَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٨</span>"},{"id":29,"tajweed":"وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْوَعْدُ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>ُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ صَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>دِق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٩</span>"},{"id":30,"tajweed":"قُل لَّك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّيعَادُ يَوْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">مٍ ل</span>َّا تَسْتَــْٔخِرُونَ عَنْهُ سَاعَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةً و</span>َلَا تَسْتَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>دِم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٠</span>"},{"id":31,"tajweed":"وَقَالَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> ل<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ن</span>ُّؤْمِنَ بِهَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُرْءَانِ وَلَا بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى بَيْنَ يَدَيْهِۗ وَلَوْ تَرَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> إِذِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ظَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِمُونَ مَوْقُوفُونَ عِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ند</span>َ رَبِّهِمْ يَرْجِعُ بَعْضُهُمْ إِلَىٰ بَعْضٍ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَوْلَ يَقُولُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتُضْعِفُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لِلَّذِينَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَكْبَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لَوْل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ لَكُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا مُؤْمِن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣١</span>"},{"id":32,"tajweed":"قَالَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَكْبَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لِلَّذِينَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتُضْعِف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أَنَحْنُ صَدَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>نَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كُمْ عَنِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْهُدَىٰ بَعْدَ إِذْ ج<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَك<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُمۖ ب</span>َلْ كُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ُّ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>رِم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٢</span>"},{"id":33,"tajweed":"وَقَالَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتُضْعِفُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لِلَّذِينَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَكْبَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بَلْ مَكْرُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّيْلِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َهَارِ إِذْ تَأْمُرُونَن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ن</span>َّكْفُرَ بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ وَنَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>عَلَ لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ند</span>َا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">دًاۚ و</span>َأَسَرُّو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َدَامَةَ لَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا رَأَوُ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَذَابَ وَجَعَلْنَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَغْلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لَ ف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> أَعْنَاقِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْۚ</span> هَلْ يُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>زَوْنَ إِلَّا مَا كَانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> يَعْمَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٣</span>"},{"id":34,"tajweed":"وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَرْسَلْنَا فِى قَرْيَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٍ م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن ن</span>َّذِيرٍ إِلَّا قَالَ مُتْرَفُوه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا بِم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أُرْسِلْت<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> كَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>فِر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٤</span>"},{"id":35,"tajweed":"وَقَالُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> نَحْنُ أَكْثَرُ أَمْو<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>ل<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">اً و</span>َأَوْلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">دًا و</span>َمَا نَحْنُ بِمُعَذَّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٥</span>"},{"id":36,"tajweed":"قُلْ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ رَبِّى يَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>سُطُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رِّزْقَ لِم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ وَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>دِرُ وَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ أَكْثَرَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َاسِ لَا يَعْلَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٦</span>"},{"id":37,"tajweed":"وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَمْو<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لُكُمْ وَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَوْلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>دُك<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّتِى تُقَرِّبُكُمْ عِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ند</span>َنَا زُلْفَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> إِلَّا مَنْ ءَامَنَ وَعَمِلَ صَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">حًا ف</span>َأُ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">وْ</span>لَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>ئِكَ لَهُمْ جَز<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ضِّعْفِ بِمَا عَمِلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَهُمْ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْغُرُفَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِ ءَامِن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٧</span>"},{"id":38,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ يَسْعَوْنَ ف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> ءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِنَا مُعَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>جِزِينَ أُ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">وْ</span>لَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>ئِكَ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَذَابِ مُحْضَر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٨</span>"},{"id":39,"tajweed":"قُلْ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ رَبِّى يَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>سُطُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رِّزْقَ لِم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ مِنْ عِبَادِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> وَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>دِرُ لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span>ۚ وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>ت<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ش</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">َىْءٍ ف</span>َهُوَ يُخْلِفُهُۖ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> وَهُوَ خَيْرُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>زِق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٩</span>"},{"id":40,"tajweed":"وَيَوْمَ يَحْشُرُهُمْ جَمِي<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">عًا ث</span>ُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ يَقُولُ لِلْمَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>ئِكَةِ أَهَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>ؤُل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءِ إِيَّاكُمْ كَانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> يَعْبُد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٠</span>"},{"id":41,"tajweed":"قَالُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> سُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>حَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نَكَ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>َ وَلِيُّنَا مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن د</span>ُونِه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ِمۖ ب</span>َلْ كَانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> يَعْبُدُونَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َۖ أَكْثَرُه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ِم م</span>ُّؤْمِن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤١</span>"},{"id":42,"tajweed":"فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْيَوْمَ لَا يَمْلِكُ بَعْضُكُمْ لِبَعْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ضٍ ن</span>َّفْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">عًا و</span>َلَا ضَر<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ًّا و</span>َنَقُولُ لِلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> ذُوقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> عَذَابَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َارِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّتِى كُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِهَا تُكَذِّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٢</span>"},{"id":43,"tajweed":"وَإِذَا تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِمْ ءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تُنَا بَيِّنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">تٍ ق</span>َالُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مَا هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِلَّا رَجُ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">لٌ ي</span>ُرِيدُ أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َصُدَّكُمْ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا كَانَ يَعْبُدُ ءَاب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓؤُكُمْ وَقَالُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مَا هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِلّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِفْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">كٌ م</span>ُّفْتَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رًىۚ و</span>َقَالَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لِلْحَقِّ لَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا ج<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَهُمْ إِنْ هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِلَّا سِحْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ م</span>ُّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٣</span>"},{"id":44,"tajweed":"وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> ءَاتَيْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>ُتُ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">بٍ ي</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>رُسُونَهَاۖ وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَرْسَلْن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِلَيْهِمْ قَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لَكَ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن ن</span>َّذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٤</span>"},{"id":45,"tajweed":"وَكَذَّبَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لِهِمْ وَمَا بَلَغُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مِعْشَارَ م<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> ءَاتَيْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُمْ فَكَذَّبُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> رُسُلِىۖ فَكَيْفَ كَانَ نَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٥</span>"},{"id":46,"tajweed":"۞ قُلْ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَعِظُك<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِو<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>حِدَةٍۖ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َقُومُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لِلَّهِ مَثْنَىٰ وَفُر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>دَىٰ ثُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ تَتَفَكَّرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْۚ</span> مَا بِصَاحِبِك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ج</span>ِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َةٍۚ إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا نَذِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">رٌ ل</span>َّك<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>َيْنَ يَدَىْ عَذَا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">بٍ ش</span>َد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٦</span>"},{"id":47,"tajweed":"قُلْ مَا سَأَلْتُك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّنْ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">رٍ ف</span>َهُوَ لَكُمْۖ إِنْ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>رِىَ إِلَّا عَلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِۖ وَهُوَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ ش<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">َىْءٍ ش</span>َه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٧</span>"},{"id":48,"tajweed":"قُلْ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ رَبِّى يَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>ذِفُ بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقِّ عَلَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>مُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْغُي<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٨</span>"},{"id":49,"tajweed":"قُلْ ج<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقُّ وَمَا يُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>دِئُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>طِلُ وَمَا يُع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٩</span>"},{"id":50,"tajweed":"قُلْ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ض</span>َلَلْتُ فَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَضِلُّ عَلَىٰ نَفْسِىۖ وَإِنِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>هْتَدَيْتُ فَبِمَا يُوح<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> إِلَىَّ رَبّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓۚ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> سَمِي<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">عٌ ق</span>َر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥٠</span>"},{"id":51,"tajweed":"وَلَوْ تَرَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> إِذْ فَزِعُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فَلَا فَوْتَ وَأُخِذُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن م</span>َّكَا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نٍ ق</span>َر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥١</span>"},{"id":52,"tajweed":"وَقَال<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> ءَامَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا بِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> وَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َىٰ لَهُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>تَّنَاوُشُ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن م</span>َّكَا<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">نِۭ ب</span>َع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥٢</span>"},{"id":53,"tajweed":"وَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لُۖ وَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>ذِفُونَ بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْغَيْبِ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن م</span>َّكَا<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">نِۭ ب</span>َع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥٣</span>"},{"id":54,"tajweed":"وَحِيلَ بَيْنَهُمْ وَبَيْنَ مَا يَشْتَهُونَ كَمَا فُعِلَ بِأَشْيَاعِه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ِم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لُۚ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َهُمْ كَانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فِى شَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">كٍّ م</span>ُّر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ِۭ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥٤</span>"}]}